their notices remain in each file (Apache-2.0 text: repository root LICENSE).

ModelCloud modifications: package-relative imports, current Transformers cache
and attention interfaces, ordinary Torch KDA, released per-expert ModuleList
ownership, cache sequence accounting, validation, strict FP32 router-buffer
policy, local definition binding and explicit plain-AWQ/fusion policy. Blocks
identical to native Transformers SolarOpen/GLM4-MoE/KimiLinear are imported.

Checkpoint metadata and the header-derived shape inventory used by tests
(tests/fixtures/ports/solar_open2) refer to upstage/Solar-Open2-250B at revision
9190fbe63a2ad8e17fc766ccceb36de7c66f004b. Its separate Upstage Solar License is
preserved in SOLAR_LICENSE. This is not a claim that the model artifacts are
Apache-only: the Solar license includes derivative-model branding conditions.
No trained tensor payload or full tokenizer asset is distributed by this port.
